Tool for printing huge banners of text in the style of the JES2 HASPPRPU module.  Has options for centre-justification, italics, and variable linewidth.

usage: hasptext [-h] [-c] [-i] [-w WIDTH] text

Convert text to IBM mainframe-style banner

positional arguments:
  text        The text to be converted

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  -c          Use centre justification
  -i          Use italics
  -w WIDTH    Width of output in columns
